  - name: ChatGPTでつくるミニチュアワークスペース｜プロンプトと設計のコツを解説
    groups:
    - name: リアルなミニチュア空間を作るプロンプト設計例
      tags:
        Airi’s_Work-in-Progress_Room: タイトル
  - name: ChatGPTでカンフーの構え（ポーズ）を再現するプロンプト24集
    groups:
    - name: カンフー構えのプロンプト早見表（ポーズ解説付き）
      tags:
        arms_cross_in_guarded_X, semi-lunge_posture: 掩手肱拳 (Yan Shou Gong Quan)
        arms_extended_horizontally_like_wings_at_shoulder_height;_feet_shoulder-width_apart, knees_slightly_bent: 白鶴亮翅 (Bai He Liang Chi)
        balanced_on_one_leg, knee_lifted;_arms_in_flowing_crane_form: 鶴立 (He Li)
        both_hands_in_dragon-like_curved_fists_thrust_forward_and_backward;_weight_shifts_fluidly_between_legs: 青龍出水 (Qing Long Chu Shui)
        complex_footwork_of_four_dynamic_steps, weight_shifting_through_multiple_positions_while_arms_guard_at_mid-level: 七星步 (Qi Xing Bu)
        deep_crouch_with_both_knees_bent;_arms_extended_forward_as_if_offering_a_peach;_weight_balanced_low: 猿猴獻桃 (Yuan Hou Xian Tao)
        feet_forming_a_T:_lead_foot_forward, rear_foot_perpendicular;_arms_guarding_at_chest_level: 丁步 (Ding Bu)
        feet_shoulder-width_apart_with_slight_knee_bend;_arms_moving_in_slow, continuous_circular_arcs_at_mid-torso_level: 雲手 (Yun Shou)
        front_leg_deeply_bent, rear_leg_fully_extended;_hands_in_a_“claw”_shape_near_chest, claws_pointed_forward: 虎步 (Hu Bu)
        graceful_knee_lift, arms_in_elegant_defensive_arc: 麒麟步 (Qi Lin Bu)
        inward_“swallow”_draw, angled_front_leg;_inward-defensive_arms: 吞步 (Tun Bu)
        knees_wide_and_low, back_straight, fists_at_mid-section: 馬步 (Ma Bu)
        low_crossed-leg_stance:_one_leg_folded_under, other_knee_raised;_arms_crossed_in_front_of_chest: 坐盤步 (Zuo Pan Bu)
        low_horse-stance_variation;_front_hand_in_tiger-claw_near_chest, rear_hand_guarding_at_waist_level: 伏虎步 (Fu Hu Bu)
        mantis-claw_guard:_front_arm_bent_at_chest_level, rear_arm_low;_both_arms_form_lethal_hook_shapes: 螳螂捕蟬 (Tang Lang Bu Chan)
        NovelAI_Diffusion_V4.5_Full: NovelAIで生成したカンフーの構えをする美少女イラスト
        one_foot_light/ready, weight_shifted_back;_balanced_guarding_arms: 玄機步 (Xuan Ji Bu)
        one_knee_raised_high, standing_tall;_arms_extended_for_balance: 金雞獨立 (Jin Ji Du Li)
        one_leg_bent_deeply_at_90°, other_leg_fully_extended_to_the_side;_torso_upright_and_balanced_over_the_bent_leg: 仆步 (Pu Bu)
        one_leg_bent_forward, other_straight_back;_arms_raised_defensively: 弓步 (Gong Bu)
        one_leg_extended, rear_braced;_dual_defensive_lines: 四六步 (Si Liu Bu)
        opening_dragon_pose, hand_raised_fluidly: 龍形起勢 (Long Xing Qi Shi)
        very_low_squat, one_leg_folded_under, other_extended: 歇步 (Xie Bu)
        weight_on_rear_leg, front_foot_light;_upright_torso: 虚步 (Xu Bu)
